contentText:
After first connecting more than half a decade ago on Instagram, Gracie Abrams and Olivia Rodrigo &#8212; who have since become stars in pop music &#8212; just reunited to talk about their friendship, lives and careers for a Spotify conversation posted Tuesday (July 7).

